    "hangar_ramp": "zone_district_893_909",
    "intro_lore": "Aircraft mean money, and money this far from downtown means somebody worked hard to keep it flying. The Threshold hangar runs on the same principle as everything else out here: whatever still works, works because somebody refuses to let it stop. The runway beyond looks like an invitation. It is, technically; you just have to survive whatever's waiting at the other end of the flight plan.",
